@startuml
title HCP-D05 Ticket-only Fee Calculation Flow
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Customer / cashier channel" as Channel
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "HikCentral connector" as Connector
participant "HCP fee calculation capability" as HCP
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

Channel -> Central : submit ticket/card reference
Central -> Central : resolve Site + AdapterMapping
Central -> Connector : request live fee calculation
Connector -> HCP : calculate fee using confirmed identifier
alt identifier confirmed and fee returned
  HCP --> Connector : fee result
  Connector --> Central : normalized fee result
  Central -> Central : record TariffSnapshot
else cardNum/ticket key unresolved or fee unavailable
  HCP --> Connector : not found / unavailable / unknown
  Connector --> Central : normalized exception
  Central -> Central : fail closed or approved review
end
Central -> Audit : fee resolve context

note bottom
Ticket-only support is not confirmed until vendor/deployment validates the lookup key.
end note
@enduml
